    "https://www.paulsmiths.edu/careers/?jobId=7bc912de-d9e5-147c-6327-af3d3e5f911d": {
      "title": "Audience",
      "description": "Careers - Paul Smith's College Skip Main Navigation Paul Smith's College Home For You For You Audience Future Students Current Students Parents & Families Veterans Local Communities Alumni Center & Institutes Center & Institutes Centers Center for Research, Partnerships, and Innovation Adirondack Watershed Institute Institute of Adventure Hospitality & Food Institute of Forestry John Dillon Park Visitor Interpretive Center Menu You are here: Home / Jobs at Paul Smith's College Jobs at Paul Smith's College Jobs at Paul Smith's College At Paul Smith’s College, we believe in investing in our employees’ well-being. We offer a comprehensive benefits package that includes not only robust health, dental, and vision insurance, but generous paid time off, including vacation, personal leave, sick leave, and holidays. We prioritize employee wellness through access to a supportive employee assistance program. A myriad of voluntary benefits are available, including short- & long-term disability insurance, accident insurance, critical illness insurance, and legal assistance. We understand the importance of work-life balance and encourage employees to take advantage of our flexible work options when possible. The College offers eligible employees with a 403(b) retirement plan account and contributes 5% of their salary towards the plan. Employees receive complimentary access to our library, gym, athletic facilities, fitness center, recreational equipment, on-campus sporting events, cultural events, and social activities. Discounts are available for on-campus dining and the college’s Mercantile bookstore. We value our employees’ academic and personal interests and offer tuition remission for employees and their dependents. Employees receive complimentary access to the Paul Smith’s College Visitor Interpretive Center (the VIC), which offers 25 miles of scenic hiking, snowshoeing, and cross-country ski trails, wildlife viewing opportunities, educational programs, and interactive butterfly exhibit. For more information or questions about careers at Paul Smith’s College, please call us at: 518-327-6179 Paul Smith's College Home 7777 NY-30, Paul Smiths, NY 12970 admissions@paulsmiths.edu Phone 888-873-6570 63° F Mainly clear, partly cloudy, and overcast Social Facebook Instagram X YouTube TikTok Live Webcams Action Visit Apply Request Info Give Bobnet Login Footer About Paul Smith's College Faculty & Staff Directory Graduate Studies Careers Mercantile Library Directions to Paul Smith's College Privacy Policy Request Info News © 2026 Paul Smith's College . All rights reserved Site Menu Search Submit site The Smitty Story Apply for Admission First-Year Applicants Homeschooled Applicants Transfer Applicants International Applicants Graduate Applicants Cost & Aid Tuition & Fees Net Price Calculator Types of Aid Applying for Aid Payment Academics Find a Program Hands-on Learning Academic Support Meet Our Faculty Graduate Studies M.S. Natural Resources Conservation M.P.S. Sustainable Tourism Management Certificates Battlefish Academy Life in the Adirondacks Housing & Dining Local Communities Clubs & Activities Health & Safety Alumni Athletics Search Submit Actions Visit Apply Request Info Give Bobnet Login For You Future Students Current Students Parents & Families Veterans Local Communities Alumni Center & Institutes Center for Research, Partnerships, and Innovation Adirondack Watershed Institute Institute of Adventure Hospitality & Food Institute of Forestry John Dillon Park Visitor Interpretive Center Close Close"
